    "rich_text_KF6HCB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_B4yDdH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Join us under the autumn  sun for a weekend of Illumination. </p><p></p><p>Our next retreat will be housed in Quarry Houses, a unique set of traditional Swedish houses in Gylsboda in Skåne, surrounded by forest and lakes.</p><p></p><p>We will immerse ourselves in a weekend of yoga, movement, breath, saunas and lake swims, nourishing food and stories and moments shared with each other. </p><p></p><p>Each day and practice will be centred around the theme of Illumination: through pranic breath, sound, and movement, we’re tapping into our life-force—the energetic current that moves through us and is waiting to be expressed. We’ll be diving deeper into this theme through workshops, astrology, and journalling—all designed to bring us closer to our playfulness and creativity. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_B4yDdH"
      ],
