    "multicolumn_DN4jXR": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_LyNrWt": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "THE VILLAGE",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p>Gylsboda is a rural village in Norra Skåne, surrounded by forests, quarries, and quiet lakes. The village has been home to writers, sculptors, and painters, who all left an imprint on this quiet village. The region, Norra Skåne, is known as the wild corner of the south, with forested hilly landscapes, historic rural architecture, and a diversity of wildlife.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_mri7qe": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "THE HOUSES",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p>The Quarry Houses in the enchanted Swedish forests are an incredible set of houses, carefully restored, with each one uniquely designed.</p><p>On the compound, there are several houses, lofts, and cottages, each with different bedrooms, sleeping lofts, and shared social spaces</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_ehNULD": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "OUR RETREAT SCHEDULE",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p>The price of the retreat includes 2 night’s accommodation at The Quarry Houses, all meals, snacks, tea, coffee throughout the weekend, all retreat programming including daily yoga, daily sauna session, and workshops. A consciously created goodie bag will be awaiting you as well.</p><p>Arrival time is scheduled for Friday morning between 10-12. <br/>Check-out is Sunday morning after Yoga and brunch.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_LyNrWt",
        "column_mri7qe",
        "column_ehNULD"
      ],
