    "multirow_P4MafE": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_HV86Dh": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gross_20260606_RaveYogaRetreat_Gyldsboda_0320_2.jpg",
            "caption": "YOGA + SOUND",
            "heading": "HELEN ERICHSEN",
            "text": "<p>Helen (@helenerichsen) is a vinyasa yoga teacher and the founder  RAVE Yoga. Combining her background in media and marketing with her passion for yoga and well-being, RAVE's unique angle is expressed through creating immersive wellness experiences in any space. Helen's creative energy lies within transforming spaces into yoga studios, using the RAVE equipment and attention to every detail. Her classes are dynamic and usually include upbeat music with an indie influence. She loves to incorporate breathwork as well as aromatherapy into her classes. Her classes are open to all levels and focus on finding balance through deeper mental and physical connection with the self. Rather than doing yoga to be good at yoga, the approach is to do yoga to be better at 'doing' life.</p>",
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_YGYqTb": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4J7A2973_390e4b9e-0e6c-4289-9da8-59b5b0356bc3.jpg",
            "caption": "YOGA, SOUND + ASTROLOGY",
            "heading": "JENNY",
            "text": "<p>Jenny is our retreat astrologer and sound bath facilitator, with a deep reverence for the transformative power of vibration. She will guide us on a journey of personal transformation through astrology workshops and one-to-one support—using your unique astrological blueprint as a tool for growth, insight, and evolution. With a background in intuitive sound therapy and sacred instruments, Jenny also creates immersive soundscapes that bring the body and mind into deep rest. Her sessions offer a space to soften, surrender, and attune to subtle inner shifts—where true transition begins.</p>",
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_QrjfT7": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-04-04_at_11.08.34.png",
            "caption": "FOOD",
            "heading": "TRINE",
            "text": "<p>Trine has a passion for creating vibrant, feel-good meals that make you want to dance in your yoga pants. For the upcoming yoga retreat, she’s ready to whip up a feast that not only fuels your body but also lifts your spirit. Think of it as food that’s as zen as your downward dog—and as delicious as the first sip of water after a sun salutation.<br/><br/>With her Danish roots and Scandinavian flair, brings a little Nordic magic to the  retreat. Her cooking is inspired by the vibrant, seasonal produce of Denmark and Sweden, where fresh ingredients are celebrated in every meal, from foraged herbs and mushrooms to farm-fresh as well as tangy pickled vegetables. Each dish is a perfect match for the yoga vibes of the weekend—light, energizing, and oh-so-satisfying</p>",
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
