    "multicolumn_r3wXHz": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_7irLFt": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "ROOMS",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p></p><p>This retreat can be booked as a single bed in a shared space, or as a double bed in either sleeping loft or private room–perfect for couples or friends who would like to stay together. If you are 3 or more friends looking to book and stay in the same house, contact us and we can look into room options. <br/><br/>Private rooms have closed access and shared bathrooms, while the sleeping lofts are charming loft spaces above shared living areas. </p><p>Payment happens in installments. The second half of your payment will be deducted April 1st.</p><p>Each space is unique in its own way.</p><p>For any questions please e-mail <a href=\"mailto:hello@rave-yoga.com\">hello@rave-yoga.com</a></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_aLJLqG": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FOOD",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p>Our chef is planning a full weekend of nourishing, plant focused meals driven by the season and nature around us. If you have any allergies or dietary restrictions, please let us know in advance so that we can accommodate. If you have any questions or special requests about the stay or practices in general, please reach out to us and we will guide you along the way. </p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_hbxC8a": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "TRANSPORT",
            "price_text": "",
            "price_color": "#3d2120",
            "sold_out": false,
            "sold_out_color": "#ff0000",
            "limited_spots": false,
            "limited_spots_color": "#ff8c00",
            "text": "<p>Gylsboda is located around 2.5 hours from Copenhagen. For those who wish to travel with us, we will arrange a joint trip with the Rave team on Friday early morning, coming back Sunday evening. Travel cost is not included in the retreat, but tickets can be purchased at the station, or in advance. </p><p></p><p></p><p>More transport info will be shared after booking.</p><p>We can help with all transport enquiries - just shoot us a mail at hello@rave-yoga.com</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
